type: software
title: "EMtrace benchmark: scoring library, job scripts, configurations and score tables"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, scoring library (ngs-benchmark), configurations, score tables and figure
  code behind the benchmark in the EMtrace manuscript: detection accuracy, consensus
  assembly, real-time replay and 16S rRNA profiling of nanopore data.
